--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- STATUS EFFECTS
-- HardCC: disables all actions (stun)
-- SoftCC: reduces movement speed (slow)
-- Buff: positive stat modifier (speed boost, jump boost, etc)
-- DamageOverTime: periodic damage (burn, poison)
-- Defensive: absorbs incoming damage (shield)
-- Immunity: prevents all damage (invulnerable)

-- IMPORTANT: When adding a status effect, go into StatusEffectHandler and modify the effect function
